        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cody Linley, Julianne Hough\n- TV Series: Hannah Montana, Dancing with the Stars\n- Seasons: Dancing with the Stars season 7\n- Organizations: ABC\n\nFacts:\n- Cody Linley was born on November 20, 1989, and he is an American actor and singer.\n- Dancing with the Stars season 7 premiered on September 22, 2008, as part of ABC's fall 2008 line-up.\n- Cody Linley played the recurring role of Jake Ryan in the television series Hannah Montana.\n- Cody Linley was a contestant on Dancing with the Stars season 7, where he was partnered with Julianne Hough and finished in fourth place.",
